7. Log how many raw items were found, how many removed, and final count.

8. Include a `--limit` optional CLI flag so the script can output e.g. top 500 or top 2000 words instead of 10k.

9. Use tqdm for progress reporting if processing a large file.

10. Script must run with NO API KEYS and NO paid services — only open datasets.
